msgid "Selection of fonts that can be used"
msgstr "Val av teckensnitt som kan användas"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: pages/brand.adoc:280
#, no-wrap
msgid "/fonts.png"
msgstr "/fonts.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/brand.adoc:282
#, no-wrap
msgid "Characters"
msgstr "Tecken"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:285
msgid ""
"Most of these characters were created as part of the Fedora Characters "
"Revamp Project. These mascots can be used in different projects."
msgstr ""
"De flesta av dessa karaktärer skapades som en del av Fedora Characters "
"Revamp Project. Dessa maskotar kan användas i olika projekt."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:287
msgid ""
"You will be introduced to Badger, Beefy, Panda and Colúr and their history "
"within the Fedora Community along with what part they belong to as well."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer att få lära känna Badger, Beefy, Panda och Colúr och deras "
"historia inom Fedora-gemenskapen, samt vilken del de tillhör."

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/brand.adoc:288
#, no-wrap
msgid "Panda"
msgstr "Panda"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:292
msgid ""
"Panda is a happy go-lucky panda with glowing ears and a glowing nuclear "
"symbol on her stomach and was originally created as a helper. You were able "
"to find her on on the 404 and 500 pages and also was in the Fedora Docs "
"pointing out tips and tricks. Panda is female and is a general mascot for "
"the Fedora community. In 2021, intern Lauryn Dake redesigned the Panda "
"during the Fedora Character Revamp Project."
msgstr ""
"Panda är en gladlynt panda med lysande öron och en lysande kärnsymbol på "
"magen, och skapades ursprungligen som en hjälpreda. Du kunde hitta henne på "
"404- och 500-sidorna och i Fedora Docs, där hon visade tips och knep. Panda "
"är en hona och en allmän maskot för Fedora-gemenskapen. År 2021 gjorde "
"praktikanten Lauryn Dake om Panda i Fedora Character Revamp Project."

