#. type: Title ===
#: pages/brand.adoc:596
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Kontakt"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:598
msgid ""
"There is a lot to the Fedora brand and there may be things we haven't been "
"able to cover in this guide."
msgstr ""
"Det finns mycket att säga om varumärket Fedora och det kan finnas saker som "
"vi inte har kunnat ta upp i denna guide."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:600
msgid ""
"However, if you need help working with the logo to make sure you are "
"following the guidelines or want to do something different with it, please "
"email logo@fedoraproject.org or log a ticket on the "
"https://gitlab.com/fedora/design/team/requests/-/issues[Design team's "
"GitLab] and we would be delighted to help you!"
msgstr ""
"Om du behöver hjälp med att arbeta med logotypen för att säkerställa att du "
"följer riktlinjerna eller vill göra något annorlunda med den, vänligen "
"skicka ett e-postmeddelande till logo@fedoraproject.org eller registrera ett"
" ärende på "
"https://gitlab.com/fedora/design/team/requests/-/issues[Designteamets "
"GitLab] så hjälper vi dig gärna!"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:602
msgid ""
"Fedora®, the Fedora word design, the Infinity design logo, Fedora Remix, and"
" the Fedora Remix word design, either separately or in combination, are "
"hereinafter referred to as \"Fedora Trademarks\" and are trademarks of Red "
"Hat, Inc."
msgstr ""
"Fedora®, Fedora-orddesignen, Infinity-designlogotypen, Fedora Remix och "
"Fedora Remix-orddesignen, antingen separat eller i kombination, kallas "
"hädanefter för ”Fedora-varumärken” och är varumärken som tillhör Red Hat, "
"Inc."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/brand.adoc:603
msgid ""
"Further information at https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-"
"US/legal/trademarks/[Fedora's trademark guidlines]."
msgstr ""
"Mer information finns på https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-"
"US/legal/trademarks/[Fedora's trademark guidlines]."

